Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:39.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单1/4决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:39.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 郑钦文 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:03.91,EN,,0,0,0,,Elena, congratulations for the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:03.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 恭喜你首次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.91,0:00:06.31,EN,,0,0,0,,into the semi -final of the US Open,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.91,0:00:06.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,闯入美网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.69,EN,,0,0,0,,and on Monday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且到了周一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.69,0:00:11.61,EN,,0,0,0,,when the new ranking comes out, you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.69,0:00:11.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,新排名公布时 你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:14.97,EN,,0,0,0,,will be officially the new world number one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:14.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,将正式成为新的世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:18.91,EN,,0,0,0,,in women's tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:18.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,在女子网坛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:23.05,EN,,0,0,0,,What does it all mean to you, Elena?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:23.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一切意味着什么 埃琳娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:25.65,EN,,0,0,0,,It's tough to find words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:25.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难用言语形容
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:28.83,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been very difficult match, and honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛非常艰难 说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:31.53,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of nerves, of course, and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:31.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然非常紧张 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:34.13,EN,,0,0,0,,it wasn't maybe the highest level,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:34.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许没打出最高水平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:35.59,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm glad that I pushed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:35.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,但很高兴我坚持了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:37.49,EN,,0,0,0,,through, and thank you so much guys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:37.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,也非常感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.49,0:00:41.23,EN,,0,0,0,,for coming, supporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.49,0:00:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,来现场支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:47.37,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been an early match. In my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:47.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛很早 我脑子里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.37,0:00:50.53,EN,,0,0,0,,I was complaining a little bit about the sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.37,0:00:50.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有点抱怨阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:52.91,EN,,0,0,0,,shadow, a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:52.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,阴影 还有很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:56.25,EN,,0,0,0,,It was definitely a battle inside me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:56.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,我内心确实打了一仗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.25,0:00:58.43,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm glad that I pushed all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.25,0:00:58.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,但很高兴我排开了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:00.81,EN,,0,0,0,,the negative thoughts away,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:00.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有负面想法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.81,0:01:02.99,EN,,0,0,0,,and I kept on fighting, and yeah, again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.81,0:01:02.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,继续拼搏 再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:07.37,EN,,0,0,0,,super happy to be in the semi -final here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:07.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,很开心打进这里的半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:10.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Not only in the semis, but also
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.72,0:01:10.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:13.78,EN,,0,0,0,,on the world number one on Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:13.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,周一还将成为世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:15.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you think about it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:15.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会想到这件事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:16.76,EN,,0,0,0,,when you are playing the match?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:16.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,在你比赛的时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:18.54,EN,,0,0,0,,You came back from a set down,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,你从落后一盘追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:20.66,EN,,0,0,0,,you saved break points in the third set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:20.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,决胜盘还救了破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.66,0:01:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,What kept you going in these moments,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.66,0:01:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些时刻什么让你坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:23.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and what kept you so strong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:23.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,又是什么让你如此坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:25.62,EN,,0,0,0,,in these important moments?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这些关键时刻？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, as I said, I didn't start that well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 如我所说 开局不好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:30.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and I was too much negative,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当时太消极了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:31.66,EN,,0,0,0,,and also it wasn't easy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且确实不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:33.16,EN,,0,0,0,,because all the matches here I played
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:33.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为之前这里所有比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.36,EN,,0,0,0,,at night, and I was scheduled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都在晚上打 原本安排
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:36.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to play once in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一次在早上打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.94,EN,,0,0,0,,but then it was raining, so basically it's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,但后来下雨了 所以算是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:42.18,EN,,0,0,0,,been the first match like this on the sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:42.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,首次在这样的阳光下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:45.82,EN,,0,0,0,,so yeah, it was a lot of unforced errors,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:45.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以有很多非受迫性失误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:47.76,EN,,0,0,0,,but then I just was telling myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:47.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来我一直告诉自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:49.88,EN,,0,0,0,,keep on fighting, keep on working
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,继续拼搏 继续努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:52.46,EN,,0,0,0,,on some things, and yeah, luckily,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,调整一些东西 幸运的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:55.82,EN,,0,0,0,,it went my way, and I'm just super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:55.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,结果如我所愿 我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:58.66,EN,,0,0,0,,You played so well, I will let you go soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:58.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得真好 很快就放你走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:01.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Now, milestone is achieved,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:01.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在这个里程碑已达成
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:02.20,EN,,0,0,0,,you are world number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.04,EN,,0,0,0,,How will you try and stay focused?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会怎样保持专注？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:06.30,EN,,0,0,0,,There are two more matches to be played.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:06.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有两场比赛要打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:07.58,EN,,0,0,0,,What will be your mental approach
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:07.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会怎样调整心态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:10.10,EN,,0,0,0,,in the next two days, hopefully, for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来的两天 但愿如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:12.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just a number right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,此刻这只是一个数字
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:13.78,EN,,0,0,0,,and of course, I'm in the semi,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:13.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 我已经进入四强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:16.78,EN,,0,0,0,,so my goal is to win the tournaments
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的目标是赢下赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:19.70,EN,,0,0,0,,which I play, and I go just match at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,我参加的赛事 一场场来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:21.34,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's an amazing achievement,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:21.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是了不起的成就
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:23.42,EN,,0,0,0,,but you know how quick everything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:23.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你知道一切变化多快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,can change in tennis, ranking wise,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,在网球中 排名也会变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:29.84,EN,,0,0,0,,during the match, so I feel like I just need
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛中也一样 我需要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:32.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to focus on my game, try to recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:32.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,专注自己的球 努力恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:35.14,EN,,0,0,0,,and enjoy tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.84,0:02:35.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后享受明天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:37.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Elena, into the semi -finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜埃琳娜 打进半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Elena Rybakina.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 莱巴金娜
